-- 126. OPUS — SAT_PARTY_IDENTITY   [Implemented]
-- 17 mapped column(s), 113 RAW column lineage row(s); 17 column(s) are 1:1 and
-- value-checked in (b). Static transform flags -- integer cast on load (decimals lost if
-- the RAW column has a scale): AGE<-AGE. converted to TIMESTAMP_NTZ on load:
