-- 137. OPUS — SAT_POLICY_HEADER   [Implemented]
-- 5 mapped column(s), 20 RAW column lineage row(s); 5 column(s) are 1:1 and
-- value-checked in (b). Static transform flags -- converted to TIMESTAMP_NTZ on load:
